<title>POLAND: Polish KPW clears Petrobank new issue.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW clears Petrobank new issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared for trade the 11,128,250 shares new issue of Petrobank SA, which will be offered to South Korea's LG Securities Co Ltd, a unit of LG Group, KPW said in a statement.</p>
<p>LG Group agreed in June to take a 50-percent plus one share stake in Petrobank, paying 12 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
